Z||000003||Formula88||11-08-2001||09:16 AM||||What year Grand Am?  If it's a 98 or older, the wheels will fit.  Stock radios will fit, although you may need a wiring adapter as they changed the plugs in the late 80's or early 90's.  Door locks, etc. will work - they're GM standard designs.  I've also heard the early 90s Grand Am seats will work great in a Fiero.  Just take the seat brackets off the Fiero seats and put them on the GA seats.  The holes are even in the same place.<P>Good Luck!||||reg||6
